  "title": "Allow chatgpt.com egress in the review workflow",
  "summary": "The review workflow runs an AI code-review job on a GitHub-hosted Linux runner behind a Docker network allowlist. This change adds one host, chatgpt.com:443, to that allowlist so the review container can reach ChatGPT-hosted endpoints in addition to the already-permitted api.openai.com. Nothing else in the job graph moves: the runner, the container image pull, the model call and the review output are all unchanged.",
